property_value: IAO:0000600 "A one-dimensional spatial region is a line or aggregate of lines stretching from one point in space to another. (axiom label in BFO2 Reference: [038-001])" xsd:string {IAO:0010000="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/bfo/axiom/038-001"}
