[Term]
id: FMA:10448
name: Intervertebral syndesmosis
namespace: fma
def: "Syndesmosis which consists of the ligaments of the vertebral column that join the spines (interspinous and supraspinous ligaments and ligamentum nuchae), laminae, (ligamenta flava) and transverse processes (intertransverse ligaments) of adjacent vertebrae. Examples: C2-C3 intervertebral syndesmosis, T3-T4 intervertebral syndesmosis, L1-L2 intervertebral syndesmosis." []
is_a: FMA:7494 ! Syndesmosis

